*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
